
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>A Little Date Invitation ♡</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&display=swap');

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 25px;
  background: #f7eee8;
  color: #382c29;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
}

.invitation {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 560px;
  padding: 55px 45px 40px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #fffaf6;
  border: 1px solid #eadbd3;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(76,47,40,.12);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.top-note, .eyebrow, .detail-label, .footer {
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.top-note {
  color: #8d7770;
}

.flower {
  margin: 25px 0;
  font-size: 30px;
  color: #a65f58;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: #a65f58;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h1 {
  font: 500 clamp(48px, 10vw, 70px)/1 'Playfair Display', serif;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
}

h1 em {
  color: #a65f58;
}

.intro {
  max-width: 350px;
  margin: 25px auto 35px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #8d7770;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.details {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  border-top: 1px solid #eadbd3;
  border-left: 1px solid #eadbd3;
  text-align: left;
}

.detail {
  padding: 20px 15px;
  border-right: 1px solid #eadbd3;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #eadbd3;
  min-height: 85px;
}

.detail-label {
  display: block;
  color: #a65f58;
  font-size: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.detail strong {
  font: 500 15px 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

.closing {
  margin: 30px 0 20px;
  color: #8d7770;
  font: italic 15px 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

.rsvp {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 15px 30px;
  background: #a65f58;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  transition: .3s;
}

.rsvp:hover {
  background: #874943;
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}

.signoff {
  margin: 22px 0 35px;
  color: #a65f58;
  font: italic 17px 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

.footer {
  color: #b29d94;
  font-size: 8px;
}

@media(max-width: 450px) {
  .invitation {
    padding: 40px 22px;
  }

  .detail {
    padding: 15px 10px;
  }

  .detail strong {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="invitation">

  <div class="top-note">
    DATE INVITATION <p></p>
  </div>

  <div class="flower">✳</div>

  <p class="eyebrow"></p>

  <h1>
 ARJAY + WILLIAM<br>
    <em>2nd date.</em>
  </h1>

  <p class="intro">
    Hi Babe, I’m excited for all 
    the our dates together— 
    Our silly conversations. I love youn so much. I
     hope being with me feels like home. Thank you babe for being there 
     all the time. 
  </p> 

  <div class="details">

    <div class="detail">
      <span class="detail-label">THE PLAN</span>
      <strong>Friday MOVIE</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
      <span class="detail-label">THE DATE</span>
      <strong>NOVEMBER 20,2026</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
      <span class="detail-label">THE TIME</span>
      <strong>6:00 PM</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
      <span class="detail-label">THE PLACE</span>
      <strong>Somewhere special</strong>
    </div>

  </div>

  <p class="closing">
    Just bring yourself. I'll take care of the rest.
  </p>

  <a class="rsvp"
     href="mailto:you@example.com?subject=Date%20invitation">
    TICKET ↗
  </a>

  <p class="signoff">
    I LOVE YOU BABY♡
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    MADE WITH A LITTLE EXTRA THOUGHT
  </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
